{title: Anointing Fall On Me}
{key: D}
{x_theme: holy-spirit}
{x_source: chrd:anointing_fall_on_me.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
A[Gbm]noin - [Bm]ting, [Em]fall  [A]on me, [Gbm]anoin - [Bm]ting, [Em]fall on [A]me;
Let the [D9sus4]power of the [D7/Gb]Holy Ghost [Gmaj7]fall on  [Gm/C]me,     a[Em7]noin - [D/Gb]ting     [A]fall [Dsus4]on       [D]me.

{comment: Verse 2}
[Gbm]Touch my [Bm]hands, my [Em]mouth, and my [A]heart, [Gbm]fill my [Bm]life, Lord [Em]every [A]part;
Let the [D9sus4]power of the [D7/Gb]Holy Ghost [Gmaj7]fall on  [Gm/C]me,     a[Em7]noin - [D/Gb]ting     [A]fall [Dsus4]on       [D]me.
